<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">MAKE ROOM FOR YOURSELF</view><view class="title">一周，有条不紊。</view><view class="subtitle">训练与恢复交替，生活也可以留白。</view><view wx:if="{{!hasProfile}}" class="card empty">建立档案后，为你安排未来七天。<button class="dark space" bindtap="profile">建立个人档案</button></view><block wx:else><view class="week"><view wx:for="{{days}}" wx:key="date" class="day {{selected === item.date ? 'active' : ''}}" bindtap="select" data-date="{{item.date}}"><text>{{item.label}}</text><text class="day-num">{{item.num}}</text><view class="dot">{{item.training ? '●' : '休'}}</view></view></view><view class="row"><text class="section" style="margin:0">{{selected}}</text><button class="link" bindtap="profile">调整计划 ↗</button></view><view wx:if="{{day}}"><view class="card hero" bindtap="workout"><text class="tag">{{day.status}}</text><view class="hero-title">{{day.title}}</view><view class="muted">{{day.training ? day.minutes + ' 分钟 · 查看动作 →' : '恢复也是计划的一部分 →'}}</view></view><button wx:if="{{day.training}}" class="secondary space" bindtap="move">调整这次训练日期</button><view class="section">三餐安排</view><view class="card" wx:for="{{day.meals}}" wx:key="id" bindtap="meal" data-id="{{item.id}}"><view class="row"><text>{{item.name}} · {{item.time}}</text><text class="tag">{{item.recorded ? '已记录' : '查看 ›'}}</text></view><view class="muted space">{{item.names}}</view></view><view class="caption">{{day.reason}} · 模板版本：{{day.version}}。示例以基础徒手训练为主。</view></view></block></view>
